{"event_type":"review","id":"7415330ef3eee1ecc2a3d823363bec3818434db5771a5729f17c4977d51cafea","occurred_at":"2026-11-04T18:21:15Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b21148041e535d198c1649b4720ba3a8a28fb1d06dff291122490d64b3fb206b","sha256":"b21148041e535d198c1649b4720ba3a8a28fb1d06dff291122490d64b3fb206b"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/9985cfcbe0c75fca16f57736cffd67bd6b68d6c6bd4c1a9854da3cdd0c9a7b9f","sha256":"9985cfcbe0c75fca16f57736cffd67bd6b68d6c6bd4c1a9854da3cdd0c9a7b9f"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/d217b85c08a7f52f026d26745580df570828d673fd00dd2953fbe8e7fda2b7b5","sha256":"d217b85c08a7f52f026d26745580df570828d673fd00dd2953fbe8e7fda2b7b5"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/be37c47c74808f750122ff742a2f0add046fdca1d28f186cd7d2e8a9d9e0294f","sha256":"be37c47c74808f750122ff742a2f0add046fdca1d28f186cd7d2e8a9d9e0294f"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/ae1980c64c69009164a84f5d74ce9d577ba09dfc60287fcfb846ddc88a144291","sha256":"ae1980c64c69009164a84f5d74ce9d577ba09dfc60287fcfb846ddc88a144291"}],"attempt_id":"58ebe5d54f55edc38985e35730983337ffb3fdbb3c6402ed81222bce6359ed63:0:1","base":"05b9934b29421d08b62285c89b489b28bcc2dc3b","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"fe493256af23ce7bff28a7de755a914b01272e21","body":"**Paginate both GitHub lists before making precheck decisions.**\n\nIf a commit has more than 100 statuses, `precheck()` can miss its newest trusted status and permit a redundant override. If the App has more than 30 installations, `install_token()` can miss the pinned installation and refuse a valid override. Follow pagination until the relevant record is found or the list is exhausted. GitHub documents both endpoints as paginated. ([docs.github.com](https://docs.github.com/en/rest/commits/statuses))\n\nAs per coding guidelines, I11 states: “REST lists paginate (`--paginate`, else truncated data).”    \n\n\nAlso applies to: 226-226","id":"e9ff3b1790ae32ba517571c9883e0ba090e7ca029edacbff6f8fdfd623ada5b5","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/crq-override","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Paginate both GitHub lists before making precheck decisions."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"fe493256af23ce7bff28a7de755a914b01272e21","body":"**Do not publish an override without a writable audit trail.**\n\nIf `AUDIT_LOG.open()` fails, `audit()` suppresses the error. The command can then publish a successful status and exit successfully without an override audit record. Require a durable audit entry before publication, and report a failure when the audit trail is unavailable.","id":"6ee3462dad6ebc9179d8cb25b84bd33aa18728daf9ec3bf4aa3e694d44ad1793","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/crq-override","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Do not publish an override without a writable audit trail."},{"anchor_status":"unverified","blob":"697adefe8920290dd1f4f8ab0d8a473154a06148","body":"**Include both validators in the pinned artifact steps.**\n\nThe installation requires `review_ledger.py` and `review-ledger.schema.json`, but the archive step at Line 62 exports only `signer/`. The later hash and installation steps also omit both files. An operator following those steps cannot stage the complete ledger installation from the reviewed commit. Add both source paths to the archive and hash instructions.","id":"4d20407630bd675c1e8311b5ad003140da11d953113c6aec5ae1e15ec4829dfc","intervals":[],"path":"apps/crq-python/signer/DEPLOY.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Include both validators in the pinned artifact steps."}],"head":"75fe60f8acdbb7749c391a634604bba7cc0a187a","head_tree":"013c2fa4bf520